# =============================================================================
# DataExpert Boot Camp — Tableau Homework
# Local / generated artifact policy
# =============================================================================
#
# Large analytical datasets are retained locally for Tableau development and
# reproducibility checks but are intentionally excluded from ordinary Git
# history.
#
# Compact executive datasets, documentation, validation summaries, scripts,
# SQL, and final grader-facing artifacts remain eligible for version control.
# =============================================================================

